      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.013 (vs ₹0.05 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.013 (down from ₹0.05 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹54.9m (up 31% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹135.0k (down 77% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.2% (down from 1.4% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 19% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 24% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
